neric/HGCD.lean#L669-L681"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Generic/HGCD.html#MPN.NatOps.hgcdReduceP\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">NatOps</span>.<span class=\"name\">hgcdReduceP</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">o</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps\">NatOps</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">base</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">α</span> → <span class=\"fn\">α</span> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/Generic/HGCD.html#MPN.Mat2\">Mat2</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">T</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <span class=\"fn\">α</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">α</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"One reduction of `a ≥ b` as in `hgcdReduce`, by half-gcd of the top third of the limbs, as GMP's\n`mpn_gcd`: the matrix and numbers of `hgcd` on `⌊a / Bᵖ⌋` and `⌊b / Bᵖ⌋` for `p = ⌊2 n / 3⌋`,\nextended to `a` and `b` by `applySplit`; by `hgcdReduce` when the matrix went too far. Half-gcd\ncosts more per limb on longer numbers, so a reduction by a sixth of the limbs from a third of them\ncosts less per limb than one by half of them from all of them.","docLink":"./MPN/Generic/HGCD.html#MPN.NatOps.hgcdReduceP","kind":"def","line":654,"name":"MPN.NatOps.hgcdReduceP","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN/Generic/HGCD.lean#L654-L667"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Generic/HGCD.html#MPN.NatOps.gcd_hgcdReduce\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">NatOps</span>.<span class=\"name\">gcd_hgcdReduce</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">o</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps\">NatOps</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">base</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">α</span> → <span class=\"fn\">α</span> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/Generic/HGCD.html#MPN.Mat2\">Mat2</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hbase</span> : <span class=\"fn\">∀ (<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>) (<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <span class=\"fn\">α</span>), <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/HGCD.html#MPN.NatOps.HgcdOK\">HgcdOK</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">a</span> <span cl