=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/HGCD.html#MPN.NatOps.SmallSteps\">SmallSteps</a></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./MPN/Generic/HGCD.html#MPN.NatOps.SmallSteps.mk","kind":"ctor","line":423,"name":"MPN.NatOps.SmallSteps.mk","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN/Generic/HGCD.lean#L423-L459"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">structure</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Generic/HGCD.html#MPN.NatOps.SmallSteps\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">NatOps</span>.<span class=\"name\">SmallSteps</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">o</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps\">NatOps</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> 1</div></div>","info":{"doc":"The operations of a base case of half-gcd by matrices of small entries, words for example, which\nthe instance applies to its numbers in its own way: `step a b` is such a matrix `S` and the numbers\n`(x, y)` with `(a, b) = S (x, y)`, from Lehmer's steps on the leading words of `a` and `b`, and\n`mulMat M S` is the product `M S`. The entries of `S` as natural numbers are `e₁₁ S`, …,\n`e₂₂ S`, and `neg S` is the sign of its determinant; `ok S` is what `mulMat` needs of `S`, such as\nbounds on its entries, and `geB b s` whether `b ≥ Bˢ`, which only affects speed.","docLink":"./MPN/Generic/HGCD.html#MPN.NatOps.SmallSteps","kind":"structure","line":423,"name":"MPN.NatOps.SmallSteps","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN/Generic/HGCD.lean#L423-L459"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Generic/HGCD.html#MPN.NatOps.stepBase_ok\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">NatOps</span>.<span class=\"name\">stepBase_ok</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">o</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps\">NatOps</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">step</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">α</span> → <span class=\"fn\">α</span> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/HGCD.html#MPN.Mat2\">Mat2</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span>)</span></span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hstep</span> : <span class=\"fn\">∀ (<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <span class=\"fn\">α</span>) (<span class=\"fn\">S</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/Generic/HGCD.html#MPN.Mat2\">Mat2</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>), <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">step</span> <span class=\"fn\">a</span> <span class=\"fn\">b</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option.some\">some</a> <span class=\"fn\">S</span></span> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/HGCD.html#MPN.NatOps.Unimodular\">Unimodular</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">S</span></span></span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class